   "text": "装备：一台有眼部追焦的全画幅机身，加一支85毫米大光圈定焦，这是人像的黄金组合。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 35.17099999999999,
   "end": 42.23799999999999,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-gear-0_893c7fe7cd53.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-gear-1",
   "scene": "c1-gear",
   "text": "35或50毫米，用来带入环境、讲故事。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 42.437999999999995,
   "end": 45.849999999999994,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-gear-1_d9876be449c9.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-gear-2",
   "scene": "c1-gear",
   "text": "再加一块反光板，和一盏能离机的闪光灯配柔光箱——从等光，变成造光。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 46.05,
   "end": 51.562,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-gear-2_9de1ab499614.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-persp-0",
   "scene": "c1-persp",
   "text": "知识一：焦段的本质，是拍摄距离。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 52.361999999999995,
   "end": 55.129999999999995,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-persp-0_b0f7c3fa534e.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-persp-1",
   "scene": "c1-persp",
   "text": "同样拍大头照，24mm要贴到40厘米，鼻子比耳朵大出两成多；85mm退到1.5米，差异不到一成。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 55.33,
   "end": 63.569,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-persp-1_060de79f3e48.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-persp-2",
   "scene": "c1-persp",
   "text": "所以85毫米显脸小，不是镜头魔法，而是它逼你退后。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 63.769,
   "end": 68.178,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-persp-2_399526190225.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-light-0",
   "scene": "c1-light",
   "text": "知识二：光位。主光从侧上方45度打来，脸颊出现一块三角光，这是伦勃朗光，最有立体感。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 68.978,
   "end": 76.75399999999999,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-light-0_6973244f9a99.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-light-1",
   "scene": "c1-light",
   "text": "光在正前上方，是显瘦的蝴蝶光；放到她身后，就是发丝发亮的轮廓光。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 76.954,
   "end": 82.255,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-light-1_51cd01034800.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-light-2",
   "scene": "c1-light",
   "text": "柔光的秘诀只有一句：光源越大、越近，光越柔。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 82.455,
   "end": 86.285,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-light-2_d18a1d59ec22.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-soft-0",
   "scene": "c1-soft",
   "text": "再加三项软功夫：按景别控制光圈，特写收一点，保证双眼清晰；",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 87.085,
   "end": 92.30499999999999,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-soft-0_66653502d9ae.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-soft-1",
   "scene": "c1-soft",
   "text": "用动作引导情绪，而不是让她僵硬地摆姿势；",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 92.505,
   "end": 95.676,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-soft-1_64cce87ccdad.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1-soft-2",
   "scene": "c1-soft",
   "text": "后期先统一肤色，再用明暗塑造轮廓。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 95.87599999999999,
   "end": 98.734,
   "file": "build/voice/c1-soft-2_a6d1a4e0462d.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-0",
   "scene": "c2",
   "text": "第二部分，风光大片。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 99.53399999999999,
   "end": 101.20899999999999,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-0_1d752c136f1a.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-gear-0",
   "scene": "c2-gear",
   "text": "风光的装备：一台高像素、高宽容度的机身，一支超广角加一支长焦——广角夸张前景，长焦压缩山峦。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 102.00899999999999,
   "end": 110.26299999999999,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-gear-0_0a339dc9cd4e.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-gear-1",
   "scene": "c2-gear",
   "text": "一副稳固的三脚架和快门线，是长曝光和包围曝光的前提。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 110.46299999999998,
   "end": 114.68899999999998,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-gear-1_27afcdaa6ee4.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-gear-2",
   "scene": "c2-gear",
   "text": "然后是滤镜三件套：偏振镜去反光，ND减光镜拉长时间，渐变灰压暗天空。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 114.88899999999998,
   "end": 120.96399999999998,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-gear-2_9ef5242bbbc4.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-time-0",
   "scene": "c2-time",
   "text": "风光最重要的知识，是时间。日出后、日落前的那段黄金时刻，光线低、暖，影子被拉得很长。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 121.76399999999998,
   "end": 129.78799999999998,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-time-0_2c89357cb009.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-time-1",
   "scene": "c2-time",
   "text": "太阳落下后的二三十分钟，是蓝调时刻，天空像深蓝色的丝绸。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 129.98799999999997,
   "end": 134.71799999999996,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-time-1_8df0f31edf8d.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-time-2",
   "scene": "c2-time",
   "text": "而正午的光又硬又平，更适合用来踩点。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 134.91799999999998,
   "end": 137.7,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-time-2_0a14343c73ff.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-dr-0",
   "scene": "c2-dr",
   "text": "知识二：动态范围。日出逆光时，天空和地面能相差十五档以上，而传感器只装得下十二到十四档。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 138.5,
   "end": 146.705,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-dr-0_0ddcf879967f.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-dr-1",
   "scene": "c2-dr",
   "text": "解决方法：用渐变灰压暗天空，或者包围曝光，后期合成。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 146.905,
   "end": 151.627,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-dr-1_13cc26dea6a6.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-nd-0",
   "scene": "c2-nd",
   "text": "ND1000能减掉10档光：1/30秒，变成34秒。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 152.42700000000002,
   "end": 157.02500000000003,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-nd-0_44289dd0cf3d.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-nd-1",
   "scene": "c2-nd",
   "text": "海浪变成雾，云变成线，时间被你写进了一张照片。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 157.22500000000002,
   "end": 161.28500000000003,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-nd-1_05b054990f06.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-focus-0",
   "scene": "c2-focus",
   "text": "知识三：构图要有前景、中景、远景三层，再用引导线把视线带进画面深处。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 162.08500000000004,
   "end": 168.50600000000003,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-focus-0_70cfa5cd9576.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-focus-1",
   "scene": "c2-focus",
   "text": "想让三层都清晰，用超焦距：24mm、F11，对焦约1.8米，从0.9米到无穷远全部清楚。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 168.70600000000005,
   "end": 177.42900000000006,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-focus-1_8bc302d2509b.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c2-focus-2",
   "scene": "c2-focus",
   "text": "近景还不够锐？那就焦点堆栈：分段对焦多拍几张，后期合成。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 177.62900000000005,
   "end": 182.85700000000006,
   "file": "build/voice/c2-focus-2_19dec820a15f.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-0",
   "scene": "c3",
   "text": "第三部分，电影级视频。电影感不靠一台贵相机，它是一套规则。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 183.65700000000007,
   "end": 188.80700000000007,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-0_565fc8299475.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-gear-0",
   "scene": "c3-gear",
   "text": "装备：能录10-bit Log的机身，一片可变ND，一台稳定器。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 189.60700000000008,
   "end": 194.3950000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-gear-0_37314e7a83af.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-gear-1",
   "scene": "c3-gear",
   "text": "最常被忽略的两样：一套无线麦克风，和一台能看波形的监视器。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 194.59500000000008,
   "end": 199.33600000000007,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-gear-1_19fb072161bf.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-gear-2",
   "scene": "c3-gear",
   "text": "因为观众能原谅画面的瑕疵，却很难忍受糟糕的声音。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 199.5360000000001,
   "end": 203.37900000000008,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-gear-2_0ff1d38ee8be.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-shutter-0",
   "scene": "c3-shutter",
   "text": "规则一：180度快门。快门约等于帧率倒数的一半，24帧就用1/50秒。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 204.1790000000001,
   "end": 211.3760000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-shutter-0_5241cde9c1b1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-shutter-1",
   "scene": "c3-shutter",
   "text": "这样的运动模糊最接近人眼；快门太快，画面就像一卡一卡的监控录像。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 211.57600000000008,
   "end": 216.7450000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-shutter-1_527d14f3e58e.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-shutter-2",
   "scene": "c3-shutter",
   "text": "可是晴天F2.8、1/50秒，就算ISO 100也会过曝约6档——所以可变ND是必需品。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 216.94500000000008,
   "end": 225.36700000000008,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-shutter-2_bd99c19cf056.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-log-0",
   "scene": "c3-log",
   "text": "规则二：拍Log，再调色。Log画面灰灰的，是因为它把亮部和暗部都存了下来。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 226.1670000000001,
   "end": 232.34300000000007,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-log-0_9085443ae674.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-log-1",
   "scene": "c3-log",
   "text": "套上LUT还原，再做色彩分级：暖肤色、冷阴影，情绪就出来了。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 232.5430000000001,
   "end": 237.86900000000009,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-log-1_5fd25817ce4b.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-log-2",
   "scene": "c3-log",
   "text": "曝光别靠眼睛，看波形和斑马纹。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 238.0690000000001,
   "end": 240.6010000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-log-2_83d25c450b55.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-lang-0",
   "scene": "c3-lang",
   "text": "规则三，也是最核心的：镜头语言。远景交代环境，中景交代关系，特写交代情绪。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 241.40100000000012,
   "end": 248.51000000000013,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-lang-0_f1dd023ab9ec.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-lang-1",
   "scene": "c3-lang",
   "text": "运镜要有动机：推，是走进内心；拉，是抽离与孤独。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 248.71000000000012,
   "end": 253.07300000000012,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-lang-1_807855055b0d.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c3-lang-2",
   "scene": "c3-lang",
   "text": "对话守住180度轴线，剪辑跟着情绪走。电影感，就是每个镜头都有理由。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 253.2730000000001,
   "end": 259.3060000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/c3-lang-2_b3d06f639ee4.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "recap-0",
   "scene": "recap",
   "text": "最后，一张图带走：",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 260.1060000000001,
   "end": 261.6860000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/recap-0_5e4cf57faa8e.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "recap-1",
   "scene": "recap",
   "text": "人像：85毫米加反光板，学焦段、光位和情绪引导；",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 261.8060000000001,
   "end": 266.4320000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/recap-1_cdb17af97c05.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "recap-2",
   "scene": "recap",
   "text": "风光：三脚架加滤镜，学光线时间、动态范围和超焦距；",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 266.5520000000001,
   "end": 271.37000000000006,
   "file": "build/voice/recap-2_a7f9821f3e6e.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "recap-3",
   "scene": "recap",
   "text": "电影：Log、ND、稳定器和麦克风，学180度快门、调色和镜头语言。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 271.49000000000007,
   "end": 277.6890000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/recap-3_6fb9b9b80d1f.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "outro-0",
   "scene": "outro",
   "text": "装备决定下限，知识决定上限。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 278.4890000000001,
   "end": 280.8790000000001,
   "file": "build/voice/outro-0_a7706026708a.mp3"
  },
  {
   "id": "outro-1",
   "scene": "outro",
   "text": "人像拍的是人，风光拍的是等待，而电影，拍的是时间。",
   "sub": true,
   "start": 281.07900000000006,
   "end": 285.35900000000004,
   "file": "build/voice/outro-1_54e11cea3e20.mp3"
  }
 ],
 "assets": {
